---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="未找到" path="/404/">
  <section class="nf">
    <div class="wrap nf__in">
      <p class="label label--amber">404 · 无信号</p>
      <svg class="nf__line" viewBox="0 0 600 80" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <polyline points="0,40 600,40" fill="none" stroke="#ffa64a" stroke-width="1.2" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"></polyline>
      </svg>
      <h1 class="nf__title">这里没有可观测的东西。</h1>
      <p class="lede">链接可能已经失效。和观澜对待缺失传感器的方式一样：空就是空，我们不编造一个页面给你。</p>
      <div class="nf__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/">回到首页</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/download/">下载</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .nf {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    align-items: center;
    padding: calc(var(--header) + 40px) 0 80px;
  }

  .nf__line {
    width: min(600px, 100%);
    height: 80px;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }

  .nf__title {
    font-family: var(--font-cjk);
    font-weight: 200;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .nf__cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }
</style>
